// ---- ROGUE REBEL: the set this mod shipped with, and the owner's own RS_Lightsaber ---------
//
// Wardust's saber set, mirroring Doom's chainsaw slots: dssabreu is the ignition -- the same
// file, byte for byte, that RS_Lightsaber plays as saber/on. It was this mod's ubqs/on until the
// Graflex import replaced it, and the owner wants it back as a choice. Every file here is
// already in the pk3; this profile costs nothing but the lines.
//
// The set has no retract of its own -- a saber hisses the same way in both directions, so the
// retract is the ignition at 0.6 -- and no blade lock, so the lock stays the mod's own.

ubqs/v3/hum                  sounds/ubqs/dssabrei.wav
ubqs/v3/on                   sounds/ubqs/dssabreu.wav
ubqs/v3/off                  sounds/ubqs/dssabreu.wav
$volume ubqs/v3/off 0.6

ubqs/v3/swing1               sounds/ubqs/dssabre1.mp3
ubqs/v3/swing2               sounds/ubqs/dssabre2.mp3
ubqs/v3/swing3               sounds/ubqs/dssabre3.mp3
ubqs/v3/swing4               sounds/ubqs/dssabre4.mp3
ubqs/v3/swing5               sounds/ubqs/dssabre5.mp3
